          "m2m100-418m"
        ],
        "detail": "The Hugging Face repositories contain no model LICENSE or NOTICE file. Both OPUS cards expose license metadata that conflicts with the fixed Tatoeba-Challenge root CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 license; the applicable weight license is therefore NOASSERTION. M2M100 exposes MIT metadata, but whether the fairseq root MIT license covers this checkpoint is not established. These metadata tags are not evidence of commercial authorization.",
